{"id": "920_board|board-tutorial|T22", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "On the wall, you hung up the big corkboard where you used to pin up photos of your nephews.", "passage": "board-tutorial", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "920_board|board-tutorial|T23", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "They’ve been gone since you got out of…", "passage": "board-tutorial", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "920_board|board-tutorial|T24", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your plan is simple: jot down all the pieces of evidence and connect them to the suspects.", "passage": "board-tutorial", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "920_board|board-tutorial|T25", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "The guilty party won’t necessarily be the one with the most evidence against them, but the one with the most compelling evidence against them.", "passage": "board-tutorial", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "920_board|board-tutorial|T26", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "It’s like you’re building a story about each suspect.", "passage": "board-tutorial", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "920_board|board-tutorial|T27", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Trying to understand their motives.", "passage": "board-tutorial", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "920_board|board-tutorial|T28", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Understand how he or she got into this situation.", "passage": "board-tutorial", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
