{"id": "920_board|board-sandman|T84", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You pick it up, look at it and put it back in the ashtray.", "passage": "board-sandman", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "920_board|board-sandman|T85", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Files on the table… evidence on the wall… Yes. Someone’s been here.", "passage": "board-sandman", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
