{"id": "920_board|board-sandman-busset|T95", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your mind carefully avoids the most obvious explanation.", "passage": "board-sandman-busset", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "920_board|board-sandman-neighbor|T100", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You smile. Your neighbors know you own nothing of value.", "passage": "board-sandman-neighbor", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "920_board|board-sandman-neighbor|T101", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "It’s a substandard building, where they rent studio apartments for a small fortune to people having a hard time. That’s what the entire city of Paris is like.", "passage": "board-sandman-neighbor", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "920_board|board-sandman-neighbor|T102", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "No… if someone broke into your place last night, it was…", "passage": "board-sandman-neighbor", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
